# Two effects that each make an ability trigger an additional time add up (CR 603.2d): with Isshin, Two Heavens as One
# ("a creature attacking") and Wulfgar of Icewind Dale ("a creature you control attacking") both out, Wulfgar's melee
# triggers three times, not four: a 7/7 attacking for 7.
# Turn 1: Wulfgar (the Mountain, Black Lotus GGG, Mox Emerald), with Mox Pearl and Mox Jet cast. Turn 3: Isshin (the
# Mountain, Pearl and Jet), then Wulfgar attacks alone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Wulfgar of Icewind Dale
Isshin, Two Heavens as One
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Wulfgar of Icewind Dale.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Isshin, Two Heavens as One.Cast
Bot1.Attack(Wulfgar of Icewind Dale > Bot2)
Bot1.Triggers(Wulfgar of Icewind Dale; Wulfgar of Icewind Dale; Wulfgar of Icewind Dale)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Wulfgar of Icewind Dale.Power = 7

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 13
